 "text": "Hi, how are you holding up? Not rude at all. A simple polite request is usually enough. Covering the cost of travel and parking is the nice bit. That's a long time. Most people save up for a few meals before returning. Ask if you can help them plan their meals, then offer to cover the price. Most people appreciate the offer. Then just say you were happy to help and move on. It' rare when people actually get upset.",
